    <h1 data-i18n="static.about.title">Practical Farming Knowledge, Rooted in Real Research</h1>
    <p class="lede" data-i18n="static.about.intro">GoOrganicAfrica is built around one simple idea: farming knowledge should be practical, tested, and shared freely across Africa.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="static.about.who">Who We Are</h2>
    <p data-i18n="static.about.whoText" data-i18n-vars='{"author":"{{ site.author }}"}'>GoOrganicAfrica's guides and tools are built by {{ site.author }}.</p>

    <h2 data-i18n="static.about.what">What We Do</h2>
    <p data-i18n="static.about.whatText">Beyond research and writing, the work behind GoOrganicAfrica spans several organic agricultural products:</p>
    <ul>
      <li data-i18n="static.about.inoc">InoculumPlus — a Mycorrhiza-based organic bio-fertilizer.</li>
      <li data-i18n="static.about.organic">OrganicGrow — an organic solution for poultry, fish and other livestock.</li>
    </ul>

